<title>NEW ZEALAND: Valuation NZ Mar qtr house price index up 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Valuation NZ Mar qtr house price index up 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valuation New Zealand said on Wednesday final figures showed its Quarterly House Price Index rose 2.3 percent in the March quarter, following a revised 2.7 percent rise the previous quarter.</p>
<p>The organisation's final house price index for the Auckland area rose 3.1 percent, against a revised 3.3 percent rise in the December quarter.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
